stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Check
  state Check <<choice>>
  Check --> Ready : ok
  Check --> Ready : forced
  Check --> Failed : error
  Ready --> Running
  Running --> Done
  Failed --> Idle : reset
  note right of Ready : waits for a worker
  note left of Failed
    logs the cause
  end note
  state Running {
    [*] --> Fetch
    Fetch --> Parse
    Parse --> Store : ok
    Parse --> Fetch : retry
  }
  Done --> [*]
